# Review from a code owner is required (branch ruleset) for every change.
# The workflow is the trust root of the npm lane; its tests and this file
# travel with it.
#
# Three owners, not two, and the reason matters: the agent that opens most of
# these pull requests authenticates as @Unobtainiumrock, so every such PR is
# authored by that account and GitHub refuses to let it self-approve. With two
# owners that left exactly one person who could ever unblock a change. A third
# owner removes that single point of dependence without weakening the rule.
/.github/workflows/   @Unobtainiumrock @goodnight000 @orange-juice-1024
/tests/               @Unobtainiumrock @goodnight000 @orange-juice-1024
/.github/CODEOWNERS   @Unobtainiumrock @goodnight000 @orange-juice-1024
*                     @Unobtainiumrock @goodnight000 @orange-juice-1024
